1
00:00:00,128 --> 00:00:01,516
Sayap pesawat ini turun rendah

2
00:00:01,536 --> 00:00:02,476
ke arah landasan.

3
00:00:02,496 --> 00:00:03,885
Pilotnya batal mendarat.

4
00:00:03,905 --> 00:00:05,151
Dan itu keputusan yang benar.

5
00:00:05,171 --> 00:00:07,334
Sabtu, 31 Oktober,

6
00:00:07,354 --> 00:00:11,632
SQ213, sebuah A350,

7
00:00:11,652 --> 00:00:13,924
diterpa angin 32 km/jam di

8
00:00:13,944 --> 00:00:16,020
Perth, hembusan 43.

9
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,652
Kru memilih go-around,

10
00:00:17,672 --> 00:00:19,329
lalu mendarat normal.

11
00:00:19,349 --> 00:00:20,692
Angin bertiup menyilang

12
00:00:20,712 --> 00:00:22,240
landasan, jadi pesawat bisa

13
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:22,580
hanyut.

14
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,648
Pilot mengarahkan moncong

15
00:00:23,668 --> 00:00:24,639
sedikit ke arah angin.

16
00:00:24,659 --> 00:00:25,785
Pesawat terbang menyerong

17
00:00:25,805 --> 00:00:26,543
seperti kepiting,

18
00:00:26,563 --> 00:00:28,210
tapi jalurnya tetap lurus.

19
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:29,789
Sesaat sebelum menyentuh,

20
00:00:29,809 --> 00:00:30,780
badan diluruskan dengan

21
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,306
rudder, dan sayap di sisi

22
00:00:32,326 --> 00:00:33,431
angin diturunkan.

23
00:00:33,451 --> 00:00:34,676
Terlalu miring,

24
00:00:34,696 --> 00:00:36,038
ujung sayap makin dekat ke

25
00:00:36,058 --> 00:00:36,677
tanah.

26
00:00:36,697 --> 00:00:38,466
Jadi pilot memadukan keduanya.

27
00:00:38,486 --> 00:00:40,029
Hembusan mengubah koreksi tiap

28
00:00:40,049 --> 00:00:40,589
detik.

29
00:00:40,609 --> 00:00:42,033
Maka ada gerbang:

30
00:00:42,053 --> 00:00:43,751
seribu kaki dalam awan,

31
00:00:43,771 --> 00:00:45,834
lima ratus kaki saat cerah.

32
00:00:45,854 --> 00:00:47,987
Kecepatan, laju turun maksimal

33
00:00:48,007 --> 00:00:49,519
seribu kaki per menit,

34
00:00:49,539 --> 00:00:51,527
dan konfigurasi harus stabil.

35
00:00:51,547 --> 00:00:52,808
Satu meleset,

36
00:00:52,828 --> 00:00:53,881
batalkan.

37
00:00:53,901 --> 00:00:54,810
Yang mengejutkan,

38
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:57,473
studi FSF menemukan hanya

39
00:00:57,493 --> 00:00:58,788
sekitar tiga persen pendekatan

40
00:00:58,808 --> 00:00:59,717
tidak stabil yang berakhir

41
00:00:59,737 --> 00:01:00,481
go-around.

42
00:01:00,501 --> 00:01:02,168
Padahal tidak batal adalah

43
00:01:02,188 --> 00:01:03,996
faktor risiko nomor satu.

44
00:01:04,016 --> 00:01:07,477
Kru SQ213 tidak memaksa.

45
00:01:07,497 --> 00:01:08,498
Tuas ke TOGA,

46
00:01:08,518 --> 00:01:09,334
daya penuh,

47
00:01:09,354 --> 00:01:10,062
hidung naik,

48
00:01:10,082 --> 00:01:11,627
flap dikurangi,

49
00:01:11,647 --> 00:01:12,786
roda dilipat.

50
00:01:12,806 --> 00:01:14,288
Ini terjadi satu sampai tiga

51
00:01:14,308 --> 00:01:16,228
kali tiap seribu pendekatan.

52
00:01:16,248 --> 00:01:17,135
Batal mendarat bukan

53
00:01:17,155 --> 00:01:18,374
kegagalan, tapi rencana

54
00:01:18,394 --> 00:01:19,167
cadangan.

55
00:01:19,187 --> 00:01:21,425
Ikuti AUDIRA untuk cara kerja

56
00:01:21,445 --> 00:01:22,232
berikutnya.

